@startuml sell-http-to-port
!include sell-style.puml
title <size:12><color:#087F8C>04 / INBOUND ADAPTER</color></size>\nTranslate at the HTTP boundary

actor Client #F3F7FA
participant "REST controller" as C
participant "Use case\nvia inbound port" as U #E6F3F1
Client -> C : POST /api/portfolios/{id}/sales\nAAPL · quantity 12
activate C
C -> C : PortfolioId.of(id)\nTicker.of("AAPL")\nShareQuantity.positive(12)
C -> U : sellStock(id, ticker, quantity)
activate U
U --> C : SellResult\n1800.00 / 1240.00 / 560.00
deactivate U
C -> C : SaleResponseDTO\nMoney → BigDecimal
C --> Client : 200 OK · JSON response
deactivate C
note over C, U
  PortfolioStockOperationsUseCase is the interface.
  PortfolioStockOperationsService implements it.
  The client does not choose the sale price.
end note
@enduml
